https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your cards truly your own by spending &quot;flashes&quot; on cosmetic upgrades. Add flair and personality to your study decks, turning every session into a visually enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Studying Enjoyable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just studying--it\u2019s an adventure. With creative tools, engaging modes, and plenty of customization options, this game transforms learning into something you\u2019ll actually look forward to. Why just study when you can play and learn at the same time?  </p>","developers":["Jammy Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/72719893f9f0ae55be4dfc396705419d02a4d887/header.jpg?t=1756300768","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3900070/80786623/59554387da64c06c6eb3e2fcbe53f5efb214450a/1754499644/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754501443","dash_h264":"https://